WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.668 --> 00:00:03.169
-JAMES GUNN: Crew get set--
-CREW MEMBER:
Look at the camera, everybody.

00:00:03.253 --> 00:00:05.505
GUNN: Crew get set
and three, two, one, go!

00:00:05.588 --> 00:00:06.381
♪ (ROCK MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:06.798 --> 00:00:09.926
Today, we are doing
the opening credit sequence.

00:00:10.009 --> 00:00:13.221
I always have dance sequences
in everything I've ever done.

00:00:13.596 --> 00:00:15.724
The actors were great on this.

00:00:15.807 --> 00:00:18.560
They all took a lot of time
rehearsing the dance.

00:00:18.643 --> 00:00:21.354
JENNIFER HOLLAND:
The song, it posits a question.

00:00:21.855 --> 00:00:24.441
And that question is
"Do you wanna taste it?"

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:27.193
♪ Do ya really wanna
 Do ya really wanna taste it? ♪

00:00:27.277 --> 00:00:29.779
JOHN CENA: We are dancing to
Wig Wam's "Do Ya Wanna Taste It"

00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:31.489
It's '80s glam hair band metal.

00:00:31.698 --> 00:00:34.951
I don't know if I'd call it
a specific style. Let's call it
"a Peacemaker groove."

00:00:35.034 --> 00:00:37.537
CHUKWUDI IWUJI:
 Charissa's created
 something that's reminiscent

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:41.082
of those old comic books,
when you see the guys go "Pow!"

00:00:41.166 --> 00:00:44.627
and they move
in these very angular ways.

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:51.217
A lot of the movement is
actually rooted in modern dance,

00:00:51.301 --> 00:00:55.263
combined with maybe
a little bit of street style,
some of the stuff.

00:00:55.638 --> 00:01:00.477
Also influenced by
Charlie Chaplin, Buster Keaton.

00:01:00.643 --> 00:01:01.603
(LAUGHTER, CLAPPING)

00:01:01.936 --> 00:01:06.608
It's a little bit like
if claymation was in human form.

00:01:06.691 --> 00:01:09.402
-♪ Devil in disguise ♪
-CHARISSA BARTON:
One, two, three, four.

00:01:09.486 --> 00:01:12.572
DANIELLE BROOKS:
 It's really cool,
because we're all so different.

00:01:12.655 --> 00:01:13.490
That's what's fun.

00:01:13.990 --> 00:01:17.243
So, to see this choreography
on many different body types,

00:01:17.327 --> 00:01:20.914
and different ages
and ethnicities, is really fun.

00:01:20.997 --> 00:01:23.500
GUNN: I'm very excited
to be able to create an opening

00:01:23.583 --> 00:01:26.377
that was very, very different
from anything else on TV,

00:01:26.461 --> 00:01:28.797
and anything else
in the DC world, for sure.

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:30.340
♪ Throw your dog
 The invisible bone ♪

00:01:30.423 --> 00:01:31.549
(EAGLY SQUAWKS)

00:01:32.467 --> 00:01:33.301
(HEAVY EXHALE)

00:01:33.593 --> 00:01:35.261
-GUNN: (LAUGHS) Cut!
-(LAUGHTER)

00:01:35.345 --> 00:01:38.139
♪ Do ya really wanna
 Do ya really wanna taste it? ♪

